    "IR sees cloud tops, not rain: cold cirrus inflates cold fractions without precipitation, so the IR ceiling may sit well below the IMERG offset-0 ceiling.",
    "Real-time NOAA bucket latency is ~10-20 min after scan; stamp t-1 at forecast time t is comfortably honest.",
    "Slots that failed to download/decode carry NaN features (hw_valid=0).",
